<title>JAPAN: INSIGHT -JGBS SEEN CONSOLIDATING ABOVE 126.50.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT -JGBS SEEN CONSOLIDATING ABOVE 126.50.</headline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>FUTURE RANGE/DAY   SPPRT    RSTNC    RSI-9   MA-5     MA-25</p>
<p>JGB  126.30-126.90 126.00   127.00   67pct   126.45   125.50</p>
<p>OUTLOOK OF BOJ OPERATION AT 0020 GMT: injection of 300 bln yen -------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Aug 8--------------------</p>
<p>*Key September 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB)</p>
<p>futures contract is likely to consolidate at higher end of</p>
<p>126.00-127.00 on Friday, ahead of release of June machinery</p>
<p>orders data at 0500 GMT. Profit-taking awaits at 126.60-126.80.</p>
<p>*Weak machinery orders data may lift September above recent high of 126.91.</p>
</text>
